«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  PoissQ
  @  Discrete quantile. Stack: lb, p.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 2; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 ≠ THEN "PoissQ: needs 2 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → lb p « IF 'p<0 OR p>1' EVAL THEN Ⓒ? ELSE 0 0 → k c « WHILE 'c<p AND k≤lb+40*√(lb)' EVAL REPEAT 'c+(lb^k)*EXP(-lb)/k!' EVAL 'c' STO 'k+1' EVAL 'k' STO END 'IFTE(k≤0;0;k-1)' EVAL R→I » END lb p 2 →List Drop »
»
